<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n33826" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">parcĭtas</span></b> , ātis,
			f.
		parcus, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>sparingness</i>, <i>parsimony</i>
			(post-Aug.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">animadversionum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sen. Clem. 7, 22</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">moderatio, parcitas, sobrietas,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Macr. Somn. Scip. 1, 8</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ciborum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cael.
						Aur. Tard. 3, 8, 118</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Pall. 1, 26,
			1</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>Mercy</i>, <i>moderation</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sine ullā parcitate verberare
					aliquem,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cassiod. 3</span></i>
			, Hist. <i><span class="en">Eccl. 2</span></i>;
					<i><span class="en">id. ib. 6, 12</span></i>.</div>
